window.products.push({"id":592006,"name":"DREFEEL White Duvet Cover Set Washed Cotton Queen Size 3 Pieces Set 1 Comforter Cover 2 Pillowcases Super Soft Durable Breathable Hidden Zipper & Corn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ig8JXwq1L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【100% Washed Cotton】: Made of 100% natural cotton fabric, a raw material handled by special process, will be softer and more comfortable than other fabric; not easy to shrink, not easy to tear, breathable, sweat-absorbent, durable and fade free. Thickness of cloth is perfect for summer and winter time. 【Classic Solid Color & Unique Design】: The surface of washed cotton fabric was high-temperature ironing double-sided blanch treatment, prominent membrane sense, and wrinkles in a slight degree reflect a sense of old materials and vintage modern look. Ecological reactive dyeing, high color fastness, no odor. unique decoration design comes with elegant feel 【Queen Size 3 Pieces Duvet Cover Set】: Includes 1 duvet cover 90 x 90 inches and 2 pillow cases 20 x 26 inches. (No PILLOW INSERT and COMFORTER INCLUDE) 【Convenient Details】: Duvet cover finished with a hidden zipper closure and corner ties keep comforter in place; pillow cases with envelope closure. Easy to remove for washing. 【Care Instruction】：Wash before first use. Machine wash or hand wash in cold water, gentle cycle; sun-dry or hang-dry; tumble dry on low; wash with similar colors; do not bleach; do not dry clean; cool iron when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ig8JXwq1L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DREFEEL","source_asin":"B09GXHJT1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GXHJT1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GXHJT1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592007,"name":"HandyMake Seagrass Belly Basket – 10 Basket Planter Styles in Small, Medium or Large for Home Décor, Laundry, Storage, Toy Organizer, Picnic, Nursery ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ELPL8GYpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HandyMake introduces another elegant and practical piece to your home décor collection with a Natural Seagrass Belly Basket for everyday use. Seagrass is an important plant making up shallow marine environments and typically used to make furniture or crafts. This all-purpose plant basket is perfect for home décor, pillow basket, towel basket, blanket storage, quilts storage, creative storage, vegetable storage, kitchen, picnic, grocery baskets, plant pot covers, flower pots, laundry, toy organizer, and nursery hamper. Our super cute belly basket is uniquely hand crafted by artisans in southeast Asia. Artisans don’t use fake wild seagrass plants, only 100% sustainably grown seagrass. Seagrass baskets are eco-friendly, beautiful, sturdy, and ultrastylish with texture for any room. Their woven design adds a breezy touch to your décor while its neutral hue fits well in a monochromatic color palette. The sea grass basket is also a bridge for coastal aesthetic. Perfect for magazines, baby supplies, linens, books, photo albums, or on-the-go accessories for practical function and natural beauty. Our basket planter is simple and easy to fit on a shelf as well as centerpiece for a living room. Incredibly beautiful and delightful, these baskets have ten (10) different basket styles and variations in small, medium, and large. Improve existing living space with seagrass baskets that can fit in cabinets, or sit on a shelf, while providing optimal storage without sacrificing appearance. They are the perfect gift for anyone who manages the home. We hope you enjoy this attractive belly basket as it has several uses including your next family gathering, cookout, barbeque, wedding shower, birthday party, anniversary party, or special event. We’ve taken great care to the small details to provide excellent style and ease of use. Get started and Order Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ELPL8GYpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HandyMake","source_asin":"B07HYTTSD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HYTTSD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HYTTSD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
