window.products.push({"id":592071,"name":"E-far 12 Inch Pizza Pan Set of 2, Stainless Steel Pizza Pie Pan Tray Platter, Healthy Metal Pizza Baking Cooking Pan for Oven, Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S2XNnkDJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you love to bake up delicious homemade pizza from scratch in your own kitchen or you are passionate for frozen pizza bought from store, then the E-far Stainless Steel Pizza Pan is an absolute essential. The 11.8 in. pizza pan is versatile; perfect for cooking a variety of foods, from pizza to biscuits, bacon, meat, burgers, fries, cinnamon rolls and more. Also great to use as a platter to serve breakfast, sandwiches or pancakes. FEATURES - Crafted from pure non-toxic stainless steel - Durable pan won’t rust, warp, chip or crack - Superior heat conductivity for even baking - Easy to clean and dishwasher safe WHY CHOOSE STAINLESS STEEL Healthier & Longer Lasting & Easy Clean 1.Stainless steel is DURABLE, long service life under proper maintenance. 2.Stainless steel is UNBREAKABLE, won’t turn into fragments and hurt children. 3.Stainless steel is HEALTHY, no toxic materials, unlike those cheaply-made plastic tableware. 4.Stainless steel is EASY CLEAN, very easy clean even by hands, dishwasher safe, no oil stains. WARM TIPS 1. You can use a light spray or grease the pan with a little oil or butter to avoid food stick. 2.Recommend not cutting the pizza on the pan to protect the beauty of surface. SPECIFICATIONS Material: Stainless steel  Color: Silver  Dimension: 11.8 x 11.8 x 0.75 inch  Package Contents: Pizza Pan x 2 USING INSTRUCTION 1. Please wash the pizza pans with warm water before first using to wash off the residue left from manufacturing.  2. Please use soft dishcloth to clean the pizza pan for the beauty of its smooth surface.  3. Please clean and dry the pizza pan after using, Store them in dry place for its durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S2XNnkDJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E-far","source_asin":"B0C3VZ6GX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3VZ6GX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3VZ6GX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592072,"name":"Lenox Blue Bay Melamine 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, 9.13 LB, 0","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":146.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J+kPsyOBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organic shapes and artisanal designs merge flawlessly on this Blue Bay set. Made from hardworking melamine, the lightweight pieces stand up to kids, poolside parties, and daily duty with carefree ease befitting boho style.At Lenox, we strive to make the daily moments in your life a bit more special. Inspired by heritage and designed for now, we bring a rich history of craftsmanship to modern day life. We’ve been a part of homes for over 130 years. Each time you buy Lenox, you are buying a versatile and timeless piece crafted with our century-long commitment to quality, artistry and beauty. Whether you’re gathering the family for dinner, grabbing a midnight snack for yourself in front of the TV or having friends over, Lenox is for real moments that last on products that are meant for living.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J+kPsyOBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B0BY5WNK6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY5WNK6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY5WNK6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
