window.products.push({"id":592155,"name":"Lance Home 3 Piceces Non Slip Sea World Bathroom Mat Set (Bathroom Carpet + Pedestal Rug + Toilet Seat Cover)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nm-QGT2gL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Technology: Thermal transfer Material: Velvet fabric, Polyester bottom, PVC mesh bottom; Thickness: 0.8cm ± 5% Size: As picture (1inch = 2.54cm) Features: (1) Velvet fabric, very soft feeling and comfortable, PVC mesh bottom, non-toxic, odorless, not moldy. (2) Easy absorb water and dust，good slip resistance. (3) Easy to clean, can be directly washed by washing machine or hands, not shed and fade, the back avoid to direct sunlight. (4) High density super soft fabrics, comfortable, environmental protection, good ventilation. Washing: Hand wash: Soak in water 10 minutes, then add the detergent or laundry detergent, scrub gently with a brush. Machine wash: Soak in water 10 mins, then folded twice into the washing machine, don't with other clothes to wash. Package includes: 1 Pedestal Rug 1 Lid Toilet Cover 1 Bath Mat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nm-QGT2gL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lance Home","source_asin":"B01LZLYCY0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZLYCY0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZLYCY0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
