window.products.push({"id":592157,"name":"Costzon Toy Organizers and Storage, Kids Toy Chest with 2 Large Storage Bins, 2 Pull-Out Drawers, Open Cabinet, Multipurpose Bookcase Shelf to Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6179T9RXg+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: It’s time for your little kid to learn to organize their own stuff! This kids truck storage organizer offers kids with 2 large storage bins, 2 small drawers, a single-door cabinet and a front-end storage bin, which are all of appropriate height for toddlers to reach. In addition, the bins and drawers are removable, the cabinet door is easy to open with a round handle, and the truck front features a removable cover. All above ensure easy access and help kids develop good habits. Say goodbye to clutters! What’s more, the ASTM & CPSIA approved storage chest is safe for kids, so you can put it in kids’ room with confidence. And the panels of the storage cabinet are interlocked together and are fixed by nuts. Therefore, you can easily assemble it, especially when there is an Allen wrench and a screwdriver for help. Features: Toy organizer with proper size keeps everything within kids’ reach With 2 large bins, 2 removable drawers and a cabinet for classified storage Large capacity front end with detachable cover is easy to use Truck shaped storage chest is both attractive and functional Made of safe and durable HDPE material for a long service life Smooth polished surface and round corner design keep kids from scrapes Simply-structured cabinet is easy to assembled with all the tools included The front end of truck is flexible in assembly, either on left or right With ASTM and CPSIA certifications Wide application for kids room, bedroom, living room and kindergarten Specification: Color: Beige Material: HDPE Overall Dimensions: 43.5\" x 13\" x 26\" (L x W x H) Interior Dimensions of Big Bin: 12\" x 10\" x 8.5\" (L x W x H) Interior Dimensions of Small Bin: 12\" x 10\" x 4\" (L x W x H) Weight Limit of Each Tier: 66 lbs Weight Limit of Front Engine: 110 lbs Net Weight: 23 lbs Recommended Age: 3 years old + Package Includes: 1 x Kids Toy Storage Organizer 1 x User’s Guide","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6179T9RXg+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costzon","source_asin":"B0BDV4768X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDV4768X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDV4768X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
