window.products.push({"id":592160,"name":"My Daughter, You are My Sunshine Musical Glitter Globe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eT0b62lnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With her happy smile and sweet disposition, your daughter brings a world of sunshine into your life. Just the sound of her laughter can lift your spirits! Now, you can share some sunshine with her when you give her the My Daughter, You Are My Sunshine Glitter Globe, a limited-edition musical glitter globe only from The Bradford Exchange. Featuring a cheerful smiling sun, puffy white clouds and golden hearts inside a sparkling glass globe, this delightful treasure is sure to bring a ray of sunshine into her life, too.Beautifully handcrafted, this thoughtful daughter gift sends a shower of sparkling glitter and golden hearts swirling around the inside with a gentle shake. Plus, it plays the sweet melody \"You Are My Sunshine.\" The elegantly designed silvery base is graced with golden swirls that frame a loving message from you: \"My Daughter, You are my Sunshine I LOVE YOU\". Adding further meaning to this lovely treasure is a touching poem card that speaks from your heart. Strong demand is expected, so order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eT0b62lnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B079K6KJBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079K6KJBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079K6KJBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
