window.products.push({"id":592234,"name":"Sugar Vine Art Alaska State Silent Non Ticking Round Battery Operated Handmade Hanging Large10.5 Inch Wall Clock for Bedroom Office Cottage Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SXnCZUOyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a silent non-ticking airplane flying above the ocean handmade home decor wall clock. Make every second count with this modern decor. This room wall decor is 10.5\" in diameter a beautiful house decor and a practical accent in any room. This unique high-quality wall clock serves as a statement piece creating a personalized environment. CLOCK FEATURES Silent clock motor with non-ticking sound Frameless and borderless open face wall clock The clock runs on one AA battery (not included)  Metal hands Pre-installed backside hook For indoor use only Requires one AA battery (NOT included Made out of durable 10.5\" MDF wood, the clock is home to a modern quartz movement made in the USA. A built-in hanger on the back of the clock movement allows for easy yet securable hanging. So, add a little joy to your house and give your living room a refreshing makeover with this soothing design that blooms with fun vibes. PRE-INSTALLED HOOK: The home decor is designed with a Built-in backside hook for easy hanging. VIBRANT COLORS: The latest printing techniques provide bright and intense colors. TECHNOLOGY & INKS: Please note that we use a laser jet printer to print the high-resolution image for excellent quality and vibrant colors. All our products come with a 2-year guarantee. QUALITY CONTROL: Each item is individually inspected before shipping, checking the print quality and positioning as well as the product itself as it should be fully functioning. WALL CLOCK PACKAGING: This 10.5\" clock is covered in plastic and then packaged in a recyclable cardboard box with styrofoam that stabilizes and protects the product during shipment. PERSONALIZATION CUSTOMIZATION: If you want this silent wall clock personalized with text added to the clock face, please leave a note in the message box when you are checking out or contact me","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SXnCZUOyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sugar Vine Art","source_asin":"B01GMX0N6E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GMX0N6E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GMX0N6E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
