window.products.push({"id":592245,"name":"Ritz Professional Silicone Coated Standard 54-inch Drawstring Ironing Board Cover with Iron Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TCXtwEa-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Ritz Professional Silicone Coated Drawstring Ironing Board Cover protects your ironing-board with scorch-resistant quality. Fits most standard size ironing boards with a drawstring adjustment to accomodate smaller and larger sizes. This Ritz cotton silicone blend board cover creates a smooth ironing surface with a built in iron rest to set your iron on when not in use. This cover measures 54-inches with room for adjustment. Features: Durable: Silicone cotton blend protects from overheating and burning of the cover. Durable: Silicone cotton blend protects from overheating and burning of the cover. Standard Sizing: Fits standard 54-inch ironing boards. Standard Sizing: Fits standard 54-inch ironing boards. Built in Iron Rest: This cover is made with a built in place to set your iron when not in use. Built in Iron Rest: This cover is made with a built in place to set your iron when not in use. Measurements: 54-inches. Measurements: 54-inches. Easy Care: Machine wash cold and tumble dry low to freshen up the cover. Easy Care: Machine wash cold and tumble dry low to freshen up the cover. Why Ritz? John Ritzenthaler Company has partnered with All-Clad Metalcrafters LLC, a professional, premium cookware manufacturer, to develop and produce a high quality textiles line to complement your home kitchen. This new line of textiles has been created with the same high regard to quality and performance, as All-Clad cookware, and has been developed to satisfy the design sensibilities of aspiring home cooks across the nation. This first ever All-Clad textile line comes in an array of 12 unique and exquisite colors that will beautifully coordinate with and enhance your home kitchen décor. The line includes: oversized solid and check kitchen towels; bold and unique fiber reactive printed kitchen towels; regular and premium silicone treated oven mitts and potholders; and oversized, easy storage dish drying mats.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TCXtwEa-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ritz","source_asin":"B00PHGW5O6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PHGW5O6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PHGW5O6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592246,"name":"Tanya Wedge Braided/Woven Placemats, Indoor/Outdoor Placemat, Kitchen Mat for Dinning Table Washable Set of 4 (Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y5KQ4WREL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Simple and stylish placemat design that gives you a high quality table life, protect your table from scratches and stains TIPS: Easy clean. Cleaned with warm soapy water by hand and dry under the shade. if there is stains in the placemat, use a brush and soapy water to clean it .No machine wash.  Perfect addition to your dining table, beautiful stylish round placemats to add more fun to your kitchen table. Widely use for family daily use indoor outdoor, kitchen, hotel or business office. Great gift for Mother’s day, Father’s day, Thanksgiving and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y5KQ4WREL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tanya","source_asin":"B07KPBMSXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPBMSXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPBMSXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592247,"name":"ZonsWorld Indoor Umbrella Stand - Rustproof and Waterproof Steel - Stylish Umbrella Holder for Entryway with Drip Tray - Decorative Organizer for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319Z8zBZRvL._AC_.jpg","description":"Keep your rainy gear sorted and safe with the door umbrella stand by ZonsWorld. Having an organizer by the front or back entrance of your house is a simple and stylish way to keep your home dry and your umbrellas, canes, and walking sticks in a convenient place. Our wet umbrellas holder is specially designed to prevent water from dripping on the floor. The removable plastic tray serves to catch droplets and is easy to clean. Plus, (unlike the typical umbrella basket organizers), our personal umbrella holder is designed to keep umbrellas, canes, and walking sticks from hanging too far over the edge, keeping everything neat and orderly. Featuring a rectangle white design with umbrella and raindrop cutouts, our front door umbrella holders elevate the aesthetics of any home decor and furnishings. Made with painted, rust-resistant steel, these decorative organizer bins will last for years to come without losing their visual appeal. Shop with confidence! If you find you aren’t satisfied with your order from ZonsWorld for any reason, you can return it within 30 days for a free replacement or total refund. Measurements: 19.3” (tall) x 7” (wide)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/319Z8zBZRvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZonsWorld","source_asin":"B085H6HCFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085H6HCFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085H6HCFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592248,"name":"Decor Therapy Jimco>Furniture-Accent, Washed Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":106.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+uv+AVadL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Curate an entryway that is welcoming and pulled together, yet full of functionality to fill the needs of your busy family. Crafted of durable Acacia wood and veneers, the sturdy Ellis entryway bench features a seat with tall, decorative X-style arms, adding visual interest to your foyer. The top of the seat lifts to reveal inner storage, perfect for keeping shoes, handbags or easy-to-lose items organized! Not just for entryways, the transitional appeal of the Ellis storage bench is perfect for adding functional seating to your living room or playroom. Measures 31.5W x 13.5D x 28.25H\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+uv+AVadL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decor Therapy","source_asin":"B09JL64NM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JL64NM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JL64NM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592249,"name":"Driini Modern Pendulum Wall Clock - Decorative and Unique Metal Frame, with 8 Inch Face - Contemporary, Minimalist Design, with Silent Non Ticking Ope","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y+xUNTnSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FORM AND FUNCTION – Stay on schedule with your Scandinavian inspired pendulum wall clock from Driini. Your unique swinging clock makes itself at home with urban design and unobtrusively silent analog operation. Included with your hanging wall clock are two pendulums: Choose the white one for a sleek and modern look, or go with gold for class and style. SMALL SIZE; BIG STYLE: Add a touch of modern elegance to any room with our swinging pendulum clock. Measuring just 8 inches in diameter and 15.5 inches in length, it's the perfect size for those who prefer a more compact clock. Don't let its small size fool you though – this clock is a cool statement piece that is sure to catch the eye of anyone who enters your office, bedroom or living room. Place it on any wall and watch as it adds a touch of sophistication to your decor. PREMIUM QUALITY – This elegant clock is crafted from wrought iron, giving it a sleek matte white finish and a sturdy weight and feel. Gold colored aluminum hands complement and contrast the clocks white face. The clock and pendulum mechanism is upgraded to a high-end unit, that offers a totally silent and non-ticking hand and pendulum motion. SIMPLE SETUP – Insert two AA's in the back of the clock (not included) and turn the setting knob to your desired time. Mount either the white or the gold pendulum, and watch it quietly swings and the aluminum hands start to glide through the hours—that’s it! DRIINI MEANS DESIGN – Choose us for unique aesthetics, minimalist simplicity, and no-nonsense function. Your wrought-iron pendelum wall clock is backed by our commitment to your complete satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y+xUNTnSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Driini","source_asin":"B0BNR6FWC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNR6FWC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNR6FWC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592250,"name":"Design Toscano Chiparus Dancer Collection, Verdigris","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N2HwzqPXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Created by an absolute master of 20th century art and design, this replica collection of dancers by Romanian-born Chiparus are meticulously hand-painted to mirror the bronze verdigris originals. \"Dourga\" depicts the unconquerable goddess who stopped every army while the \"Snake Dancer\" embodies the winning victory over any foe. Created in quality designer resin to capture the subtle nuances that sell for thousands at auction, these collectibles are set atop museum mounts. Dourga: 7\"Wx3\"Dx15\"H. 1 lb., Snake: 7\"Wx3\"Dx11\"H. 1 lb.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N2HwzqPXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Design Toscano","source_asin":"B00IDBZBBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IDBZBBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IDBZBBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
