window.products.push({"id":592545,"name":"[2022 Upgraded] Ice Cube Tray for Freezer, Orelex Ice Trays with Bin and Press Lid, Features of 1s Release Ice Cubes, Large Ice Cubes, BPA Free, Perfe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n6TENhXmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【One-Second Release】2022 Upgraded ice maker for freezer. Just press the lid coming with the ice trays, all of the ice cubes will fall into the bin. No more wasting time on ice cube trays that require a lot of twisting and turning. Don't worry about accidentally spilling the large ice cubes out. 【Four Steps To Releasing Ice】The bottom of the ice cube mold is designed with silicone material. Place the ice cube trays face down on the ice bin, then cover and press the lid, the ice cubes will fall off. At last, you can pick the ice cubes out with the scoop. 【Stackable Design for Saving Space】The ice tray for freezer can be stacked and will save your maximum space. Two ice trays for freezer makes 64 Large ice cubes each time. Note: Please don't wash it by dishwasher. 【DIY Ice Cubes & Multi-Purpose】Large ice cubes are suitable for use in whiskey, soda, vodka, cocktails, juice, coffee, and for keeping some cold food or drinks cooler for longer. Also, you can DIY the ice cube trays with fruits, ice cream, baby food into the ice cube tray to make your desired ice cubes. 【Food Grade Silicone】 The silicone ice cube tray is made of safe and high quality food grade PP, TPE and PET, silicone materials, 100% BPA free. Superior materials and scientific design make them both extremely strong and resilient.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n6TENhXmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orelex","source_asin":"B0C5R1YT3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5R1YT3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5R1YT3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592546,"name":"Riedel Vinum Tasting Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BBYj-rhYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Riedel tasting glass serves the same purpose as the I.N.A.O. Glass, while improving several aspects of judging wine. The additional value of the glass is to measure precisely the amount of wine poured by filling the hollow stem. Swirling the wine in the glass enables evaluation of the \"nose\". Unfortunately, in a conventional glass, only half the possible surface is reached by the liquid to show aroma intensity. To maximize the aeration space in the Riedel tasting glass, lower the glass gently into a horizontal position. The wine will flow from the hollow stem to fill the bowl to just half an inch below the rim. Because of its shape, no wine will be spilled. A 360-degree \"rolling\" Rotation will then create a very thin layer of wine on the complete inner surface of the bowl, maximizing the evaporation surface and detailed olfactory information. The available Quantity of wine is sufficient for two sips: The first to evaluate the wine and the second to confirm the evaluation. The distribution of the wine flow is guided mainly to the front part of the tongue, emphasizing the fruit. The delivery to the sides and back of the tongue accentuates acidity and the bitter components, allowing the wine to show all its flavors in a harmonious and balanced way Amazon.com Founded in 1756, Austria's Riedel Crystal is the world's premier manufacturer of wine glasses. The Vinum series of glasses are made of over 24-percent lead crystal and were the first machine-made glasses to be specifically designed for a particular grape varietal. The tasting glass in this set are intended for evaluating a variety of wines at a professional tasting. The unique hollow stem design acts as a measurer and holds 5/8 ounce or two sips of wine (one to judge the taste and one to confirm)--the ideal amount for tasting. The bowls of these glasses have a wider opening for comfortable sipping without tilting the head all the way back. The bowls also offer completely balanced sipping by simultaneously sending wine to the front of the tongue to highlight the fruit and toward the back and sides of the mouth to emphasize the wine's acidity. The bowl's larger volume provides more space for wine to aerate, making aromas more intense than in a differently shaped glass. Tilting the glasses to a horizontal position provides the best aeration, and the design stops wine 1/2-inch from the rims to keep it from spilling. Each glass stands 6-3/8 inches tall and holds a maximum capacity of 14-7/8 ounces of wine. Currently awaiting a patent, these glasses are sure to be the new standard for unbiased wine judging. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31BBYj-rhYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riedel","source_asin":"B00021YHPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00021YHPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00021YHPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592547,"name":"Japanese Cute Cat Design 7.48 Inches Soup Ramen Noodle or Serving Bowl Mike from Japan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31cviJOl9uL._AC_.jpg","description":"Minoware refers to the great tradition and classical style of Japanese pottery. With a long history dating back over 1300 years, it is both an art form and a functional craft that produces practical items for daily use. It was certified as a traditional craftwork by The Ministry of International Trade and Industry in 1978. Minoyaki is a broad term that encompasses several styles of pottery with diverse colors, finishes, and enamels. Some famous examples of Minoyaki are as follows: Hino-Yaki is rich black or brown, warm and earthy. Oribe-Yaki is fresh with dark greens and less constraints on the traditional design. Kiseto-Yaki is known for light yellow and intriguing washes of green paints. Setokuro is glossy and black, achieved with quick high temperature firings. The name Minoyaki itself references the Mino region where it originated, located in the present-day Gifu Prefecture with high concentrations of Minoyaki artisans in Toki City, Tajimi City, Mizunami City, Kani City. Today the Mino region still produces over 50% of the pottery made in Japan. In the rich and complex world of Japanese arts and aesthetics, Minoyaki is of great cultural value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31cviJOl9uL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mino Ware","source_asin":"B07W5GKT1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W5GKT1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W5GKT1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
