window.products.push({"id":592578,"name":"Maamoul Bakhoor Variety Box & Burner by Dukhni | Authentic Arabic Oud Bakhoor Incense | 10 pcs Bakhoor, 5 Mixed scents | عود بخور مبخرشمعدان","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6164YEZOGIL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"CONTENTS: 5 fragrances of Maamoul Bakhoor x 2 pieces each with a Signature Bakhoor Burner & 1 tealight candle Description: Dukhni Maamoul Bakhoor Variety Box is carefully curated to include a wide assortment of fragrances. From sweet and floral to rich, deep and woody scents, It also works well to eliminate cooking smells. A gift of discovery, our Maamoul Bakhoor Variety Box is a great way for you to experience a range of Dukhni Bakhoor. The signature smoke-free Oriental bakhoor burner allows you to fragrance your home regularly without the mess or smoke and you can enjoy a long lasting aroma. Dukhni Bakhoor is ideal to light before prayer time, while reading Quran, meditating, relaxing or after cleaning your home. It also works well to eliminate cooking smells DEPTH OF FRAGRANCE: Bakhoor lies at the cornerstone of Arabic culture as an age-old method of delightfully fragrancing the home. Dukhni Bakhoor is made from a traditional recipe using sustainably-sourced natural ingredients for their aromatic properties. Each fragrance is derived from various combinations of aromatic extracts, botanical extracts, essential oils, spices, woods, and resins HOW TO USE: To set up the signature burners; place the metal burner on the wooden coaster and the copper plate above the burner. Simply place a piece of bakhoor on the copper plate and light the tealight candle below. Only use t light candles with a 3.5 hour burn time. The scent will steadily diffuse without smoke ensuring its longevity. In an unventilated room, the aroma of the bakhoor will spread to about 400 square feet. Dukhni Bakhoor also burns well the traditional way on charcoal. HERITAGE: Dukhni has specialized in the art of developing fragrances and incense since 1907. Our journey began in Aden, which formed part of the historic Incense Route. In our quest to be able to translate memories and emotions into experiences, we take great care in creating exceptional products that are compellingly precious yet personal","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6164YEZOGIL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dukhni","source_asin":"B0836Z4SW1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0836Z4SW1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0836Z4SW1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
