window.products.push({"id":592719,"name":"Armana Productions LED Liquor Shelf and Bottle Display - Programmable Shelving Includes Wireless Remote and Power Supply","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":123.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7199VQl-sUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"29 Inch LED Liquor Shelf - Remote Controlled - Armana standard width LED illuminated Liquor Shelves are the thinnest on the market, measuring in at only .75\" thick.  - Using powerful RGB LEDS that are rated at over 50,000 hours allows you to choose from an unlimited number of colors.  - Included wireless remote control lets you choose from predetermined colors and effects, such as fading and flashing. Or, create your own color scheme and store it in the remote for quick access.  - Our LED shelves are perfect for illuminating bottles, glassware, artwork, or any item of your choosing.  - Our rugged design is tough enough to stand on, and with our long last LEDs, you'll enjoy our shelves for many, many, years to come.  - Our standard width Liquor Shelves measure 4.5\" wide and .75\" thick.  - Standard lengths are 2' to 8'  - Armana Liquor Shelves can be connected, up to 16' on one power supply and remote.  - Our shelves are made modular, so if there is ever an issue with the LEDs or power supply, they can be easily swapped out. Features: - 100% flame resistant acrylic - No MDF used  - Glossy black on the front and sides with a frosted top  - LED lighting completely encased  - Flame polished to eliminate sharp edges  - Durable, liquid resistant construction  - CE certified 3-chip RGB LED lights  - Low-heat LED's rated at 50,000 hours  - 44 Key RGB wireless remote to control unlimited colors and multiple lighting effects  - Made in the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7199VQl-sUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Armana Productions","source_asin":"B019KY4142","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019KY4142","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019KY4142","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592720,"name":"Renaiss 33.9x27.6 Inches Astrology Tapestry Trippy Retro Moth Dead Head Mystical Geometry Mandala Wall Hanging Mysterious Psychedelic Celestial Art Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p-DYDoBJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Welcome to our Renaiss shop. Material feature: Our tapestry is made of 100% lightweight polyester, soft, durable, skin-friendly. HD Printing Technology: Our tapestry is with featuring vivid colors and crisp lines, it will give you an elegant feeling for any space. Unique Design: The magical artwork will give you a different novelty experience. Our tapestry will make a complete transformation to your room. Easy to Wash and Iron: Our tapestry can be washed by machine or hand with cold water on gentle cycle. Hang dry only. Please iron it at lower temperature. Easy to Hang: This tapestry is very easy to hang by using decorative tacks, push pins, thumbtacks, command strip or velcro tapes. Customized service: we can supply other normal size for this tapestry, and customized design as well with your HD picture if you need. Usage As a home decor, the tapestry is available for Bed Cover, Tapestry, Curtain,Couch cover, Wall Hanging.  ->Festival/wedding decoration, Restaurant/shop decoration, College/dorm Decoration, Festival flags.  ->Picnic/Beach Sheet/ Blanket, Yoga mat etc Perfect gift for all occasions as well Package Included: 1 × Tapestry Accessories: Thumbtacks x2, Clips x2, 3M Double-sided Adhesive x2, Hooks x2 Tips Dry clean or gentle hand wash in cold water. Do not tumble dry, do not expose to the sun, do not rub hard About Color: Please note that every computer has different color and resolution settings so colors shown on your screen may vary slightly from the actual print depending on your setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p-DYDoBJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Renaiss","source_asin":"B08H7VQCX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H7VQCX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H7VQCX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592721,"name":"Butcher Knife, EXTTE 7.8 Inch Meat Cleaver Knife Heavy Duty, Kitchen Knife for Bone Cutting, Ultra Sharp Chinese Chefs Knife with Ergonomic Pakkawood ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tv+LJi+lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Laser-etched Damascus pattern: The laser-etched pattern blade is strikingly beautiful. Laser etched to look like Damascus steel. It is not really Damascus steel. As a multifunctional and professional kitchen knife, the big blade shape is designed for slicing, dicing, mincing, and chopping meat vegetable, and fruit, such as beef, tomato, pepper, butternut squash, and cabbage. Unique Blade Shape Design: With three specially designed small holes at the top front corner of the cleaver knife, it can buffer the force when chopping bones to a certain extent. The 7.8-inch length makes it different from traditional 7-inch meat cleavers, when you hold it in hand you could feel a strong sense of power. Triple-riveted Full Tang Handle: Triple-riveted Full Tang Handle: For the butcher knife, comfort, safety, and reliability will be top of consideration, therefore three rivets of the handle and the rounded blade spine are designed to ensure maneuverability, providing you with a better sense of control and comfort. Razor-like Sharpness: Symmetrical 15° per side V-shaped Cutting Edge for excellent sharpness. Our unique oil-cooling treatment ensures our meat cleaver knife reaches 58±2 Rockwell hardness for extraordinary performance in edge-retention. Premium Material: EXTTE meat cleaver is forged from high carbon 5Cr15MOV, premium stainless steel reaching the high hardness at 58 HRC and features an acute 15° cutting angle per side for a noticeable sharpness. The unique oil-cooling treatment and tempering process along with up to 14.9% Chromium ensures that our chef's knives are equipped with great tensile strength, reliable ability to retain an edge, and better power to resist wear as well as corrosion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tv+LJi+lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EXTTE","source_asin":"B09YV4K1NK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YV4K1NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YV4K1NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592722,"name":"Marlee 2-Pack Room Darkening-Rod Pocket Window Panel Pair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91z1rocSYfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Room Darkening Energy Savings. Our microfiber window panels help to reduce the amount of light that comes in through your windows. This not only allows for darker rooms, but helps to keep heating and cooling costs down by insulating your home by cold blocking and heat blocking. This is a big plus for customers that want to do everything they can to be energy efficient. These solar blocking panels are perfect additions to your living room or bedroom. SUNCLIPSE ROOM DARKENING CURTAINS are the best source for all of your room darkening and light blocking needs. Our window curtain panels not only provide thermal, noise reducing, light blocking technology, but also give your bedroom, living room, kitchen or bathroom an updated and decorative aesthetic. There is no need to sacrifice style for functionality with Sunclipse Window Curtain Panels. The Marlee Window Curtain Drape Set of 2 Panels features a solid texture that fits into any home décor style. Absolute Privacy. Sunclipse Window Curtain Panel Pairs provide your home with another level of privacy. These drapes are easily pulled across the curtain rod to give you easy, affordable privacy from your neighbors. These ready-made window curtain panels come in 63 inch and 84 inch sizes to give you the amount of room you need for any window in your home. Find our full selection of Sunclipse Panels and Create an energy efficient space in every room of your home! Sleep Soother n Noise Buffer. It is a no brainer that darker rooms promote deeper sleep. Hang these window curtain panels in your kid’s nursery, your teen’s room, or your master bedroom to block out those early morning sun rays. These panels are also perfect for your living room when watching a movie. No one wants the sun to block their family time! These panels help to block the outside noise as well as ambient light from surrounding light sources.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91z1rocSYfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunclipse","source_asin":"B07VB4Z7ZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VB4Z7ZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VB4Z7ZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
