window.products.push({"id":592730,"name":"Portable Neck Fan, Personal Misting Fans Nano Mist Sprayer for Facial Hydration and Cooling, USB Mini Desk Fan Rechargeable Battery Operated Fan for S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lA2g3IpES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Annoyed by the hot weather when outside? Wanna a safe portable fan for your children? Wemordu upgraded necklace fan can help, let the stylish appearance fan give off strong airflow and cool you down, say no to hot flashes! Why choose us? ⛄ 1.Unique 3 in 1 design: Neck Fan: It can free your hands, especially when you are working outdoors, playing mobile games, exercising, you need to use both hands, then the traditional handheld fan can not meet your needs, and Wemordu fan can make you do anything in the hot summer is very convenient and keep you cool; And this powerful fan is also a good helper for fast drying makeup, so it can also be used as makeup fan or eyelash fan. Mist Fan: Most of the fans are just for cooling, which will take the water from your body and make your body dry and uncomfortable. A mist fan is an ideal choice! You can use it as a face steamer, or a small air cooler, nano-mist blew by the wind to your face can make you cool quickly. Desktop fan: Open the fan's bracket, it immediately becomes a desk fan, thus avoiding the problem that the foldable fan is easily broken. ⛄ 2.Powerful wind 3 adjustable wind speed; Each time you press the button can let you feel the improvement of wind power. ⛄ 3.Safety The fan's air inlet and outlet have safety grid to prevent fingers from touching the blades, whether for adults or children are very safe. ⛄ 4.Easy to charge The battery-powered fan can be easily charged by any USB-enabled device. The charging light turns red when charging, and goes off when full. ⛄ 5.Small size & portable This pocket Size mini fan is very easy to carry around, it’s a handy fan. Package List: 1 Misting fan 1 Water bottle 30ml 1 USB cable 1 Lanyard Note: Do not add more than 15ml of water (Water overflow will affect the use of the fan)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lA2g3IpES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wemordu","source_asin":"B07PP2ZHF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PP2ZHF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PP2ZHF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
