window.products.push({"id":592816,"name":"TOPCHANCES Pasta Machine, 180mm Automatic Electric Pasta Machine Noodles Press Machine Noodles Cutter with Clamp for Spaghetti Lasagna Tagliatelle, 3m","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":429.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WqxMc76NL._AC_SL1007_.jpg","description":"Pasta Machine Instruction : 1. Kneading the noodles: add warm water to flour (about 4:1), and put salt and alkali in the water appropriately: if you make egg noodles, you can add no or less water, and mix together in the basin. 2. Preparation: Cut the mixed dough into slices (about 20 mm), and sprinkle some dry flour for later use. 3. Before use, check the working surface, remove the surface dirt, and add some lubricating oil to the face knife bushing and gear. 4. Rolling surface: first remove the dough cutter, adjust the adjusters at both ends of the DZM series pressing roller or adjust the left adjustment lever of the HO series, adjust the gap between the two rollers to 2.5-3 mm, and insert the plug into the socket of the 220V power supply. Press the switch on the machine, put the reconciled noodles into the noodle hopper, introduce them between the noodle rollers, repeat the rolling 4-5 times, finally adjust the noodle roller gap 1.5mm, and press again.  5. Noodle cutting: Install the noodle cutter, adjust the adjuster of the noodle cutter as needed, turn the adjuster clockwise to cut fine noodles, counterclockwise to cut coarse noodles, and finally put the pressed noodles into the noodle bucket, and introduce The noodles can be cut into thick or thin noodles between the two rollers until the noodle cutter. 6. Finish: After use, turn off the machine power switch, unplug the plug, and clean the machine body, knife and roller. Notice : 1.The operating voltage must meet the requirements. 2.A three-wire socket must be used, and the socket must be grounded. 3. Do not adjust the regulator when running under load. 4. During operation, hands should avoid touching the knife and roller to avoid danger, and pay special attention to not allowing children to operate. 5.When adjusting the thickness of the dough sheet, it should be used in order from thick to thin to avoid damage to the machine. 6. In order to p","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WqxMc76NL._AC_SL1007_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPCHANCES","source_asin":"B07FF41TJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FF41TJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FF41TJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
