window.products.push({"id":592824,"name":"IMAX 89036-2 Fork and Spoon Wall Decor, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IEY3yzqqL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Fork & Spoon Wall Decor, Set of Two-Inspired by the Folk Art movement, this folksy wall decor set has been artisan-crafted of iron. A charming and decorative accent ideal for the kitchen, dining room, or bar area, the spoon has lovely scalloped pattern embellishments. Both have soft pastel finishes that have been gently antiqued for the look of a true vintage find. The fork measures 38.25 by 6.5 by 1.75\" and the spoon measures 37.75 by 7.5 by 2\". The set has been finished by hand with exemplary detail. There will be slight variations in finish, color and texture. These variations are a reflection of the authenticity of the piece and signal the originality of the artisan. Care instructions: Dust with a clean dry cloth. Brought to you by IMAX- One source, a world of choices. (Mounting hardware is not included.).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IEY3yzqqL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Imax","source_asin":"B008Z767CA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008Z767CA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008Z767CA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592825,"name":"MUPATER Vanity Set with Lighted Mirror and Cushioned Stool for Bedroom, Makeup Dressing Table with 3-Color Touch Screen Dimming Mirror and 4 Drawers f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7194C23FFQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3-COLOR TOUCH SCREEN DIMMING MIRROR】The design of our makeup vanity set is built-in LED strips to achieve a variety of lighting effects to meet your different needs. You can adjust the color and brightness according to different scenes and makeup needs by the buttons on the touch screen mirror which without flickering and glare, bringing you a comfortable visual experience. 【ELEGANT AND STYLISH DESIGN】This vanity set is made of high-quality solid wood and non-toxic P2 MDF, which is super sturdy, solid and strong for long-time daily use. It has elegant looking by combination black and gold, and anti-slippery part fixed in the leg bottom to avoid scratch your floor. The drawer handles are designed with modern metal pull ring which is stylish and elegant, make the vanity table set high-end fashion and suitable for any indoor style scene. 【SPACIOUS AND PRACTICAL STORAGE】The vanity set with lighted mirror has 4 drawers which enough to place your jewelry, hair accessories, nail polish, and cosmetics in it and make your room looks more organized. There are two big silent slide drawers without partitions and two small cases which can meet your needs to manage items efficiently. You can also easily decorate the desktop according to your needs, such as placing small potted plants or other decorative products on it. 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE AND MAINTAIN】Assembling a traditional common vanity set might not be easy, and we definitely recognize it! You'd love this makeup desk for its simplified assembly which is time-saving. Just some simple assembly is required by attaching the legs to the stool and table, as well as assembling the mirror and attaching that. Maintain is also easy, just use a soft cloth to wipe down the dust. 【IDEAL CHOICE】Believe this vanity set with 3-color touch screen lighted mirror and cushioned stool will be your ideal choice as a gift for your girls, lover and mothers! Overall maximized height: 52.7''. General table size: 35.4''W x 16.5''D x 29.5''H. Stool size: 15.5''W x 11.6''D x 18''H. The large drawer size: 19.5''W x 12''D x 2.4''H. Small cases size: 7''W x 3.4''D x 2.2''H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7194C23FFQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUPATER","source_asin":"B093SX3ZFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093SX3ZFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093SX3ZFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":592826,"name":"DESTALYA Turkish Teapot Set, Stainless Steel Double Tea Pots for Stove Top, Tea Maker with Strainer, Samovar Tea Kettle, Water Heater Warmer (Midi wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LsPDSwlML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turkish Teapot Set: Samovar style teapot set with self strainer is made from top-quality 18/10 Stainless Steel. It has ergonomic and heat insulated plastic red handles that allow for a comfortable grip while holding the pot. It is suitable for Turkish tea, green tea, herbal tea, blooming and loose leaf tea. It is a home décor item for your kitchen to give vintage style and retro look. Functional Tea Kettle Set: It holds the heat for a long time thanks to the three layer capsule bottom and saves energy. It is safe to use on an Oven, Induction Cookers, Electric, Gas, Halogen and Ceramic Stovetops. It is suitable for a tea party, camping and travelling. Optimum Capacity: Midi Size Tea Maker set contains 4 pieces: 1 bottom, 1 top and 2 steel lids. The top teapot has a self-strainer and the base pot has holes in it. Teapot capacity: bottom 57.5 oz and top pot 40.5 oz. (Bottom 1.70 L and top 1.20 L). Elegant Design: The bottom of the tea kettle is designed to be flat and more stable on the stovetop. Thanks to the self-strained brew chamber, the filters help you to remove the leaf in your tea cup. You can also brew and serve your tea or hot beverages to your liking. Use and Care: Easy to use and clean. It is dishwasher safe or you can wash by hand. Made in Turkey. It makes a lovely gift or present, for Christmas, Housewarming, Birthday, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Wedding and any special days and for Adults, Men, Women. Enjoy your tea!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LsPDSwlML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DESTALYA","source_asin":"B0BCJZTLJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCJZTLJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCJZTLJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
