window.products.push({"id":592860,"name":"NUTRIUPS Wine Decanter Decanter for Wine Crystal Aerating Decanter Red Wine Decanter Wine Decanters and Carafes Snail Shaped Design with Slanted Spout","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612uoTKBy8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Pierced Decorative Design】The eye-catching Snail Pierced shape is a conversation starter when your guests over. The contemporary design of red wine decanter also adds styles and decors when on the table. The hollow round shape is naturally a handle that provides a stable grip, making it easier to pour and clean. 【Perfect Present for Wine Enthusiasts】This decanter for wine is specially designed GIFT BOX intended to create an instant “WOW” feeling. Impressed your lovers on Holidays, Birthday, Wedding, Anniversary, Housewarming, etc. Buy it, Gift it, Love it. 【Free Brush】Cleaning brush included, which is the nice necessary addition to wine decanter and carafe. 【Exclusive “Ding” Sound for Crystal Glass】 NUTRIUPS wine decanter is 100% made of Lead-free crystal glass by hand blown every single one, which is heavier and brighter than glass. Thanks to this, NUTRIUPS decanter for wine is not only stable and long lasting, but also can reflect the color of red wine very well. With a quick flick from your finger it gives a ding sound which is unique to crystal glass. 【Personalized 375ML Design for 1~2 People:】When half bottle of wine is poured into wine carafe decanter, the wine reaches the maximum aeration area of this special designed personalized small wine decanters. In order to taste the best flavor, decanted red wine should be finished in one meal. Decanting half bottle of wine each time is the most economical way to reduce waste. It is certain that the red wine decanter will bring you much happiness in the form of wine!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612uoTKBy8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUTRIUPS","source_asin":"B08BLMFY4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BLMFY4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BLMFY4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
