window.products.push({"id":592890,"name":"Jillson Roberts Christmas Cupcake Ornament, Magenta Tree Glitter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+Q41ZpEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What a fun idea-holiday treats for your Christmas tree. Jillson Roberts cupcake ornaments are hand cast and carefully hand painted which gives them a \"looks good enough to eat\" posh bakery goods appearance. Each festive little cupcake sits in a fanciful holiday baking cup and is lavishly topped with swirls and swirls of decorative frosting embellished with sparkly glitter, confetti, sprinkles or rhinestones. The cupcakes measure approximately 2-1/2-Inch in diameter and are approximately 3-1/2-Inch high-just the right size to be admired by one and all as they hang from the tree by their pretty metallic cords. All Jillson Roberts cupcake ornaments are presented in holiday gift box packaging which makes them ideal for gift-giving. After the holidays, the box can also be used to safely tuck the ornament away-but we won't tell if you'd rather leave your cupcake out year-round. With 21 dreamy designs from which to choose, there's a Jillson Roberts cupcake ornament for everyone on your holiday gift list. The ornaments are designed to happily mix and match with Jillson Roberts gift wraps, tissues, wine and bottle bags, ribbons, raffia, crinkle shred and colorful Tyvek padded mailers to let your unique holiday style shine. Jillson Roberts is proud to offer the largest, most comprehensive presentation of eclectic and environmentally sensitive paper products available on the market today; proof that one can, indeed, give beautifully and responsibly. They invite you to explore their fresh and innovative collections available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+Q41ZpEYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jillson Roberts","source_asin":"B009ED6NOG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009ED6NOG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009ED6NOG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
