window.products.push({"id":592905,"name":"Giantex Cooling Weighted Blanket for Adults 20lbs |60\"x 80\" | Queen Size, Luxury Cooling Silk Sewed in Cotton Fabric-Soft to Touch & Nano-Glass Beads,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oZHmv5TqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Cotton 【Fast & Deep Natural Sleep】: This weighted blanket offers the gentle feeling of being hugged for you, which is designed to reduce the tossing and turning throughout the night and give you a deep, healthy, relaxing sleep. It can help you relax your body, calm your mood and improve your sleep quality. 【Cool Feeling Weighted Blanket】: Covered with cool-feeling fabric, it increases sensory stimulation. And it is so smooth and breathable that can help you stay cool through summer nights so you do not overheat, helping you sleep well all night. It isn’t just ideal for night’s sleep, also a perfect choice when you watch TV or read books. 【Safe & High Quality Materials】: This weighted blanket is filled with environmentally friendly premium cotton and high quality, small glass beads that are evenly distributed in each compartment, helping to avoid noise when turning over. And it's certified, so you can use it safely. 【7-layer Structure & Advanced Sewing Technology】: High Density stitches is designed to prevent the loose of the thread and leakage of the glass beads. The latest process and innovative 7-layer structure are built to surround your body comfortably and form to your body shape while sleeping. 【Intimate Design】: Our weighted blanket is engineered to be around 10% of your body weight, giving you a natural relaxing experience. With eight fixed ropes, you can attach them directly to the duvet cover and keep the blanket in place. It is the perfect sleeping gift for Christmas, Valentine's Day and birthday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oZHmv5TqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B07WF85W6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-592905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WF85W6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WF85W6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
